{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/05/30/0484611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯のカバーを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変えてしまった！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くぅぅぅぅううううう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいったぜ...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/05/30/0484611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとこんな手帳みたいのが欲しかったんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んで、だいすきなアンゴラウサギちゃんをつけました。意外とちっちゃいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃわぁぁあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて可愛らしいモフモフなんだっ！！！！！！くそぉっ！！！！( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぉぉぉおおおおおおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にくい！にくいぜ！罪なヤツだぜ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モフりたい！モフりたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から慎んで┗(^o^ )┓ふぉっふ！ふぉっふ！ふぉっふ！ふぉっふ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、前のカバーすっごい大事にしてたから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いこと買うの迷ったぜぇ(´^ω^`;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていうのも、乃木坂に入って上京するときに、お母さんが少し早いお誕生日プレゼントって、新しい携帯とそのカバーを買ってくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その上、クラスのみんなとバイバイするときに、そのカバーの裏にみんながメッセージを書いて渡してくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともと物を大切にする精神のわたしだけど、そのカバーは、別格にすっごく大切にしてきたんです。(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂と一緒に歴史を歩んできた訳だけど、もうさすがにボロボロなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こいつは大事にお部屋にしまっておくことにします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも、物や人は大切に！( ^o^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然関係ないけど、旅行いきてぇぇぇえええええ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ"}],"source":"archive"}